tags: usb-model, usb

A fact of a device on USB: its model, as the USB vendor id and product id.

The value is the two ids as 4 lowercase hexadecimal digits each, separated by ":".
Example: 046d:0825. A rate of a device can use this fact as its scope.

An absent fact: the node gives no USB model. The node is bound: it attests the fact.

